# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files — never commit real secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local/dev media uploads
#
# IMPORTANT (Phase 0 -> Phase 10 carry-over):
# This `uploads/` entry exists ONLY to keep local-dev-time uploaded files out of git.
# It must NOT be taken as a hint about where production uploads should live.
#
# In production, the uploads directory MUST live OUTSIDE this `api/` checkout entirely
# (e.g. /var/www/rejuvenate/uploads on the VPS — see deploy/README.md and
# architecture.md §11 / ADR-0004). `git pull` and `npm run build` (which empties/rewrites
# `dist/`) must never be able to touch the real uploads directory. Wiring the upload
# path via an absolute, environment-configured value (not a path relative to this repo)
# is a hard requirement — see the Phase 10 deploy notes.
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Prisma — generated client lives in node_modules, nothing to ignore here yet
